			identifier: function.alreadyNarrowedType
			count: 1
			path: ../html/public/local/coursepilot/classes/admin/remoteaccesscohorts_setting.php

		-
			# reason: load_choices() loads cohort options after the is_array early return; PHPStan considers that branch unreachable because the inherited choices property is typed array. Reconcile it with the null constructor value used for lazy loading.
